  "solution": {
    "text": "The given reaction is for the industrial preparation methanol from a mixture of carbon monoxide and hydrogen . In the reaction the gaseous mixture is subjected to 200 atmosphere and then passed over heated catalyst mixture of ZnO and $\\mathrm{Cr}_2 \\mathrm{O}_3$ kept at $573-673 \\mathrm{~K}$. This reaction results the formation of methanol vopours which are then condensed to liquid state.",
